        "created_at": "2012-11-29T05:46:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What is the ratio of cards / dollar for all cards released up to and including Infernal Relics?</p><p>1104 / $85 = 13.0 [1]</p><p>What is the ratio of cards / dollar for all cards that will be released for Shattered Timelines and Vengeance?</p><p>682 / $50 = 13.64 [2]</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The above does not include shipping and assumes that one got all promotions possible during conventions and/or Kickstarters. All prices are rounded up to the nearest dollar.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>[1] 1104 = EE cards (578: 10 hero decks x 41; 4 villain decks x 27; 2 env decks x 15) + Rook City (222: 2 hero decks; 4 villain decks; 2 env decks; 2 extra cards for The Operative) + Infernal Relics (228; 2 hero decks; 4 villain decks; 2 env decks; 8 extra cards for The Ennead) + Young Legacy, Alt Wraith, Cosmic Omnitron (2 cards), Mad Bomber Blade (2 cards), Unity, and Ambscade</p><p>$85 = $40 for EE + $20 for Rook City + $20 for Infernal Relics + $5 for Unity</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>[2] Based on standard deck sizes.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Shattered Timelines - 220: 2 hero decks; 4 villain decks; 2 env decks</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Vengeance - 355: 5 hero decks; 5 villain decks; 1 env deck</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Dark Visionary, The Freedom Six, The Assistant, Silver Gulch, The Scholar, Eternal Haka, Greatest Legacy, Final Wasteland</p><p>$50 = $20 for Shattered Timelines plus $30 for Vengeance</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:50.543Z",
